{
  "description": "This protocol performs part 1 of a custom NGS library prep workflow: PCR Prep 1.\nExplanation of complex parameters below:\n* track tips across protocol runs: If set to yes, tip racks will be assumed to be in the same state that they were in the previous run. For example, if one completed protocol run accessed tips through column 5 of the 3rd tiprack, the next run will access tips starting at column 6 of the 3rd tiprack. If set to no, tips will be picked up from column 1 of the 1st tiprack.",
